      "description": "IPIP items measuring ADHD-related symptoms.",
      "citation": "Span, S. A., Earleywine, M., & Strybel, T. Z. (2002). Confirming the factor structure of attention deficit hyperactivity disorder symptoms in adult, nonclinical samples. Journal of Clinical Psychology, 58(5), 497-507.",
